                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: We need to find a way to attract more people to our gym. I’ve been looking at the number of people signed up for my personal training sessions. There’s been a significant drop.\\nB: I’ve had the same problem. I think a lot of potential customers cannot afford our rates.\\nA: Right. And we only give a discount on personal training the first time it’s done.\\nB: How about starting group training sessions for beginners? It would be more affordable, so we could get more people interested in working out with us.\\nA: That’s a great idea. Let’s do it.\"}]]}]]}"
